{"translation-revision-date":"2026-10-31 19:27+0100","generator":"WP-CLI\/2.12.0","source":"build\/index.js","domain":"messages","locale_data":{"messages":{"":{"domain":"messages","lang":"hu_HU","plural-forms":"nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);"},"AI \/ MCP":[""],"Skills":[""],"(opens in a new tab)":[""],"LW Plugins (opens in a new tab)":[""],"Try again":[""],"Loading\u2026":[""],"That did not work. Please reload the page and try again.":[""],"On":["Be"],"Needs attention":[""],"%d skill":[""],"LW Site Manager home":[""],"LW Site Manager sections":[""],"Documentation":[""],"MCP server":[""],"Bundled skills":[""],"Copied":[""],"Copy":[""],"Connect a client":[""],"Point any MCP client at this site. It connects over HTTP with WordPress application passwords.":[""],"The server is off. Turn it on above before you connect a client.":[""],"Endpoint":[""],"the endpoint URL":[""],"Create an application password":[""],"Use an administrator account: the connection needs the manage_options capability. Give the password a name you will recognise, such as the client\u2019s name.":[""],"Open your profile":[""],"Application passwords are not available on this site. WordPress offers them only over HTTPS or on a local environment, and a plugin or filter can also turn them off.":[""],"Build the Authorization header":[""],"Base64-encode your user name and the application password joined by a colon, and put the result in place of <code>%s<\/code>. On macOS or Linux:":[""],"Paste the snippet into your MCP client":[""],"For Claude Code, add it to the .mcp.json file in your project folder. Other clients take the same URL and header in their own settings.":[""],"the .mcp.json snippet":[""],"Bound to":[""],"Who can connect":[""],"Administrators, with an application password":[""],"On another domain":[""],"Switches itself off":[""],"MCP server is on":[""],"MCP server is off":[""],"AI agents can connect to this site and use its abilities as tools.":[""],"The MCP endpoint refuses every request. The Abilities REST API is not affected.":[""],"Connected agents can run write and destructive abilities. Keep it on only on sites you control.":[""],"Once on, connected agents can run write and destructive abilities.":[""],"Off":["Ki"],"Turn on":[""],"Turn on the MCP server? Any AI agent with an administrator application password can then run every ability on this site, including ones that change or delete content. The server stays bound to this domain.":[""],"Built-in":[""],"Step-by-step playbooks for common jobs. Agents find them in the discover-abilities result and load one with the skill-get ability.":[""],"Not listed for agents":[""],"No skills are registered.":[""],"Other plugins can add their own skills through the lw_site_manager_skill_sources filter.":[""],"MCP server turned on.":[""],"MCP server turned off.":[""]}}}